<td style=" BORDER-BOTTOM:0.75pt solid #050505;vertical-align:bottom">&#160;</td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM:0.75pt solid #050505;vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:0.60em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Calibri Light;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#050505">The Annual Meeting will be held in a virtual meeting format via live webcast at <span style="text-decoration:underline">www.meetnow.global/M4FHMTJ</span>. You will not be able to physically attend the Annual Meeting in person.</span></p></td></tr>
