<td style="vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:3.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Calibri Light;text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Calibri;color:#e22382"><span style="font-weight:bold">By Mail:</span></span><span style="font-family:Calibri Light;color:#050505"> If you received a full paper set of proxy materials, date and sign your proxy card and mail it in the enclosed, postage-paid envelope. You do not need to mail the proxy card if you are submitting your proxy by internet or telephone.</span></p></td>
