<td style="vertical-align:top"><div style="color: rgb(5, 5, 5); letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;"><div style="display:inline;"><div style="font-weight:bolder;display:inline;">&#8195;SITE Centers Corp.</div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(75, 75, 75); letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;"><div style="font-style: normal;display:inline;"><div style="font-style:italic;display:inline;">&#8199;</div></div><div style="font-family:Times New Roman;color:#696969;display:inline;"><div style="font-family: SYMBOL; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;">&#239;</div></div><div style="color:#4b4b4b;display:inline;"><div style="font-style: normal; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;"></div></div><div style="font-style: normal;display:inline;"><div style="font-style:italic;display:inline;">&#8199;2026 Proxy Statement</div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(5, 5, 5); letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;"><div style="background: none;display:inline;"><div style="font-weight:bolder;display:inline;">&#8195;</div></div></div></td></tr></table></div></div><div style="margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:0em; page-break-before:always"></div><hr style="color:#999999;height:3px;width:100%;clear:both"/><div style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 1.67em; margin-bottom: 1.67em;font-weight: bold;"><div style="font-weight:bolder;display:inline;"><a href="#toc">Table of Contents</a></div></div><div style="width:800px"></div><div style="text-align:center"><div style="width:8.5in;text-align:left;margin-left: auto;margin-right: auto"><div style="font-size:4pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</div>
