<td style="width:2%;vertical-align:top;text-align:left"><span style="color:#050505">(1)</span></td>
<td style="width:1%;vertical-align:top">&#160;</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Calibri Light; font-size:8pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#050505">The amounts reported in columns (c)&#160;and (d) for 2025 include amounts deferred into our 401(k) plan (a qualified plan) and our elective deferred compensation plan (a nonqualified plan) by Messrs. Morgan and Kitlowski for the year ended December&#160;31, 2025 as follows: Mr.&#160;Morgan, $20,750; and Mr.&#160;Kitlowski, $76,000. Under our elective deferred compensation plan, deferred amounts were to be payable to the named executive officer at a date specified by the named executive officer at the time of his deferral election in accordance with the provisions of the plan. As further described below, the elective deferred compensation plan was terminated on February&#160;27, 2026. </span></p></td></tr></table> <p style="font-size:3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
<table style="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Calibri Light; font-size:8pt;border-spacing:0;width:100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
