<td style="width:2%;vertical-align:top;text-align:left"><span style="color:#050505">(2)</span></td>
<td style="width:1%;vertical-align:top">&#160;</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Calibri Light; font-size:8pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#050505">The amounts reported in column (d)&#160;for Messrs. Morgan and Kitlowski reflect the amounts paid to them as their respective annual cash bonuses for 2025 pursuant to their respective employment agreements (determined on the basis of a qualitative, subjective evaluation of performance for 2025). For information about these bonuses, see &#8220;Compensation Discussion and Analysis &#8212; 2025 Compensation Program &#8212; Annual Incentive Compensation Decisions.&#8221; </span></p></td></tr></table> <p style="font-size:3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
<table style="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Calibri Light; font-size:8pt;border-spacing:0;width:100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
