<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"><span style="color:#050505">According to a report on Schedule 13G/A filed with the SEC on January&#160;8, 2026 by BlackRock, Inc., BlackRock, Inc. is the beneficial owner of 4,260,895 common shares and has sole voting power over 4,146,715 common shares and sole dispositive power over 4,260,895 common shares. The address for this reporting person is 50 Hudson Yards, New York, New York 10001. </span></td></tr></table> <p style="font-size:3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
