<div style="width:800px"></div>

<div style="text-align:center"><div style="width:8.5in;text-align:left;margin-left: auto;margin-right: auto">
 <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:30pt; font-family:Calibri Light" id="toc937168_77"><span style="color:#050505">Appendix B </span></p><div style="line-height:10.0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:2pt;border-bottom:1.00pt solid #050505">&#160;</div> <p style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt; font-family:Calibri;text-align:center"><span style="color:#050505"><span style="font-weight:bold">PROPOSED AMENDMENT TO THE COMPANY&#8217;S AMENDED AND RESTATED </span></span></p> <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt; font-family:Calibri;text-align:center"><span style="color:#050505"><span style="font-weight:bold">CODE OF REGULATIONS TO REPLACE THE EXISTING MAJORITY VOTING POWER QUORUM REQUIREMENT </span></span></p> <p style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt; font-family:Calibri;text-align:center"><span style="color:#050505"><span style="font-weight:bold">ARTICLE I </span></span></p> <p style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Calibri Light"><span style="color:#050505">Section&#160;5. <span style="text-decoration:underline">Quorum</span>. The <span style="text-decoration:line-through">holders of shares entitling them to exercise a majority of the voting power</span> <span style="text-decoration:underline">shareholders</span> of the Corporation entitled to vote at any meeting<span style="text-decoration:line-through">,</span> present in person <span style="text-decoration:line-through">or</span>, by proxy<span style="text-decoration:line-through">,</span> <span style="text-decoration:underline">or by use of communications equipment</span> shall constitute a quorum for the transaction of business to be considered at such meeting; provided, however, that no action required by law or by the Articles of Incorporation or these Regulations to be authorized or taken by the holders of a designated proportion of the shares of any particular class or of each class may be authorized or taken by a lesser proportion. The holders of a majority of the voting shares represented at a meeting, whether or not a quorum is present, may adjourn such meeting from time to time, until a quorum shall be present. </span></p>
 <p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&#160;</p>
